{"id":"fw-010","type":"rule","dimension":"portfolio","statement":"市场严重低于历史均值时扩大弹性，正常区间维持稳定收息，严重高于均值时降低弹性；判断用 5 年分位，不用绝对点位。","conditions":["组合层","A股","港股"],"as_of":"2026-06-01","effective_from":"2026-06-01","status":"active","confidence":"high","reviewed":true,"reviewed_at":"2026-11-04","reviewed_by":"repo","supersedes":null,"evidence":{"kind":"framework","path":"framework.md","section":"5. 市场水位与弹性"},"notes":"来自现有 framework.md 的结构化整理，不是视频原话。"}
